Crystal Cheese was added in '''Beta 39.1''' as a 3/3 for 4G monster with the Magic of being able to catch a <= 8G Dust monster of your choice out of 3 randomly picked ones. Its Dust would release a 1/1 copy of the chosen monster. '''Beta 55.1''' changed its Magic to instead show 2 random [[Angel of Death|Lost Souls]].

=== Stats ===
ATK: 3

HP: 3

Cost: 4

Abilities:

* Magic: See 3 random <= 8G Dust monsters.
**Catch 1. Dust: Release a 1/1 copy of it. (Post Beta 39.1)
* Magic: See 2 random Lost Souls.
**Catch 1. Dust: Release a 1/1 copy of it. (Post Beta 55.1, Current)

Rarity: Blue (Rare)
